        "transmutation"
      ],
      "entries": [
        "The izfiitar continuously tinkers with the myriad possibilities in which it can move or manipulate magic. The izfiitar is always quickened and can use the extra action only to Cast a Spell, Step, or Stride."
      ]
    },
